    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Features:",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>✔ Unique design ensuring comfort, curved round edges, and a polished surface to reduce pressure<br\/><br\/>✔ Easy to hold and use<br\/><br\/>✔ Ergonomically designed with a long handle to help minimise gag reflex and allow for a smoother cleaning experience<br\/><br\/>✔ Portable & durable – perfect for both home & travel<br\/><br\/>✔ Expert-designed for safe and effective daily use<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in the box?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<p>Each package contains:<\/p><ul><li>1x Portable Stainless Steel Case<\/li><li>1x Stainless Tongue Scraper<\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "3442c9b0-dbb6-4dd7-b615-9313ba45f523": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Instructions & Tips",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Here's to getting the most out of your Stainless Tongue Scraper<\/p><p>1. Moisten tongue with water or mouth wash.<\/p><p>2<strong>. <\/strong>Open your mouth.You'll want to open your mouth as wide as is comfortable, but not so wide that it causes discomfort. This makes your tongue more accessible and increases the ease of scraping.<\/p><p>3. Remove the residue generated from brushing, by scraping your tongue with the scraper. <\/p><p><\/p><p>4. Repeat this process until you notice residue from your tongue has been removed.<\/p><p><\/p><p>5. Rinse mouth to remove the loosened material leaving the tongue clean and fresh.<\/p><p>6. Clean the Tongue Scraper with water and store.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "2eef6090-250f-48ad-a4ec-4aacca83c975": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cautions",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "row_content": "<p>✘ Do not force into tight spaces between teeth. <\/p><p>✔ Children require adult supervision.<\/p><p>✔ Please make sure to wash your mouth with warm water after use.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "dc156c5a-46c9-43e5-acbd-475340353fc0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use the electric dental cleaning kit?",
            "icon": "washing",
            "row_content": "<p>1. Select your desired attachment based on your oral needs.<\/p><p>2. Turn on the device and alter between modes based on your cleaning needs.<\/p><p>3. Alter between heads if necessary.<\/p><p>4. Clean the device and the tip after use. <\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cons of not using an Ultra Sonic Tooth Cleaner",
            "icon": "star",
            "row_content": "<p>Bad dental hygiene can be devastating on teeth and gums. Not only can it be expensive, but it can also lead to bad breath, gum disease, receding gums, dental decay, and even tooth loss.<\/p><p>This product may also be reffered to as one of the following:<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Calculus remover, Dental irrigator, Dental scaler, Oral irrigator, Plaque remover, Tartar removal tool, Tartar remover, Tooth cleaner, Tooth stain remover, Ultrasonic dental cleaner, Ultrasonic scaler, Ultrasonic tooth cleaner.<\/em><\/p><p><\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
